        "description": "Elevated inflammatory markers such as ESR and CRP",
        "category": "supportive",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of periosteal new bone formation on imaging with onset before 6 months of age and associated soft tissue swelling",
    "notes": "Genetic testing for COL1A1 mutations may support diagnosis but is not mandatory"
